<http://ahip.org/demographics/ValueSet/ahip-interpreter-modes> a fhir:ValueSet ;
  fhir:nodeRole fhir:treeRoot ;
  fhir:Resource.id [ fhir:value "ahip-interpreter-modes"] ;
  fhir:DomainResource.text [
     fhir:Narrative.status [ fhir:value "extensions" ] ;
     fhir:Narrative.div "<div xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml\"><p class=\"res-header-id\"><b>Generated Narrative: ValueSet ahip-interpreter-modes</b></p><a name=\"ahip-interpreter-modes\"> </a><a name=\"hcahip-interpreter-modes\"> </a><p>This value set includes codes based on the following rules:</p><ul><li>Include these codes as defined in <a href=\"http://terminology.hl7.org/7.4.0/CodeSystem-v3-ParticipationMode.html\"><code>http://terminology.hl7.org/CodeSystem/v3-ParticipationMode</code></a><span title=\"Version is explicitly stated to be 6.0.0\"> version ?6.0.0</span><table class=\"none\"><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\"><b>Code</b></td><td><b>Display</b></td><td><b>Definition</b></td></tr><tr><td><a href=\"http://terminology.hl7.org/7.4.0/CodeSystem-v3-ParticipationMode.html#v3-ParticipationMode-PHONE\">PHONE</a></td><td>Telephone</td><td>Participation by voice communication where the voices of the communicating parties are transported over an electronic medium</td></tr><tr><td><a href=\"http://terminology.hl7.org/7.4.0/CodeSystem-v3-ParticipationMode.html#v3-ParticipationMode-VIDEOCONF\">VIDEOCONF</a></td><td>Video</td><td>Participation by voice and visual communication where the voices and images of the communicating parties are transported over an electronic medium</td></tr><tr><td><a href=\"http://terminology.hl7.org/7.4.0/CodeSystem-v3-ParticipationMode.html#v3-ParticipationMode-FACE\">FACE</a></td><td>In-Person</td><td>Participation by voice communication where parties speak to each other directly.</td></tr></table></li><li>Include these codes as defined in <a href=\"CodeSystem-ahip-demo-additional-nullFlavor.html\"><code>http://ahip.org/demographics/CodeSystem/ahip-demo-additional-nullFlavor</code></a><span title=\"Version is not explicitly stated, which means it is fixed to the version provided in this specification\"> version ?0.1.0</span><table class=\"none\"><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\"><b>Code</b></td><td><b>Display</b></td><td><b>Definition</b></td></tr><tr><td><a href=\"CodeSystem-ahip-demo-additional-nullFlavor.html#ahip-demo-additional-nullFlavor-CNTR\">CNTR</a></td><td>I choose not to respond at this time</td><td>This code is to represent explicitly that the patient has chosen not to respond to this question at this time.</td></tr></table></li></ul></div>"
  ] ;
